{include file="./header.tpl"}

  <script src="/template/js/swiper-bundle.min.js"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/template/css/swiper-bundle.min.css" />
  <div class="swiper banner-swiper banner saas-banner">
    <div class="swiper-wrapper">
        <div class="flex swiper-slide" style="background-image: url('/template/images/banner-saas1.jpg')">
          <div class="w">
            <div class="text">API-纯SaaS化服务</div>
            <p>基于电子印章云服务能力，为用户的各类业务系统提供标准化的集成接入服务</p>
            <div class="apply-to-use none"> <a class="btn btn-free">申请试用</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex swiper-slide" style="background-image: url('/template/images/banner-saas2.jpg')">
          <div class="w">
            <div class="text">API-本地计算管理服务</div>
            <p>用章文件不出用户内部网络完成文件用印，满足用户文件管理及印章管控需求</p>
            <div class="apply-to-use none"><a class="btn btn-free">申请试用</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="tc saas-tabs">
    <div class="item active">
      <i class="ico ico-saas"></i>
      <p>API-纯SaaS化服务</p>
    </div>
    <div class="item">
      <i class="ico ico-basic"></i>
      <p>API-本地计算管理服务</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="saas-con">
    <div class="solution1 saas1">
      <div class="w">
        <div class="tc head">
          <h2>服务特点</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="flex">
          <li>
            <div class="item">
              <i class="ico ico-saast1"></i>
              <div class="name">即买即用</div>
              <p class="desc">无需新增计算资源、安全资源</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="item">
              <i class="ico ico-saast2"></i>
              <div class="name">半小时上线</div>
              <p class="desc">无需系统部署，调用云端电子印章能力即可完成接入</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="item">
              <i class="ico ico-saast3"></i>
              <div class="name">安全稳定</div>
              <p class="desc">采用 HTTPS 与双通道国密算法做通讯传输安全保障</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="item">
              <i class="ico ico-saast4"></i>
              <div class="name">权威认证</div>
              <p class="desc">平台通过等保三级、密评，全流程数据存证</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="saas2">
      <div class="w">
        <div class="tc head">
          <h2>开放平台</h2>
          <p>基于电子印章服务，融合各种底层服务能力，封装成多种核心服务中间件API，<br />通过平台为OA系统、业务系统等提供标准化集成接入服务</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex box">
          <img src="/template/images/saasopen.png" alt="开放平台" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="saas3">
      <div class="w">
        <div class="tc head">
          <h2>接入方式</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="flex box">
          <div class="img">
            <img src="/template/images/ukey1.png" alt="唤醒客户端本地高效签署" />
          </div>
          <dl>
            <dt>唤醒客户端本地高效签署</dt>
            <dd><p>面向用章人提供的本地化签章客户端，实现文件收发、在线文件签章、本地文件签章、骑缝章、多页签章、大文件签章、文档查验、文档转换等功能。</p></dd>
            <dd class="links"><span class="tc">本地化</span><span class="tc">安全密钥盘</span><span class="tc">大文件</span><span class="tc">便捷安装</span></dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="flex box">
          <div class="img">
            <img src="/template/images/sign1.png" alt="跳转网页端无插件集成签署" />
          </div>
          <dl>
            <dt>跳转网页端无插件集成签署</dt>
            <dd><p>基于授信token与OSS技术，确保签署身份安全与并发稳定，实现同网页系统低耦合对接，支持在线签章、骑缝章、多页签章、文档查验等功能。</p></dd>
            <dd class="links"><span class="tc">接口授信</span><span class="tc">免插件</span><span class="tc">耦合低</span><span class="tc">快速集成</span></dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="flex box">
          <div class="img">
            <img src="/template/images/smsH51.png" alt="短信链接H5签署" />
          </div>
          <dl>
            <dt>短信链接H5签署</dt>
            <dd><p>基于短信通知能力实现签署方H5短信链接签章,高效便捷。通过多种身份验证增加签署安全性。移动H5签署通过便捷、实时、灵活、安全等特性满足现代化移动化办公需求。</p></dd>
            <dd class="links"><span class="tc">短信通知</span><span class="tc">移动应用</span><span class="tc">“零”耦合</span><span class="tc">快速集成</span></dd>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
